1783790807777385	bones-dev/0	itc:v3:AWLJ5JJzkkzyZJQAAAAAQdequ6retUAAAAEyAw		item.comment	bn-r2zy	{"body":"Started in workspace bn-r2zy. Root cause: incremental_apply advances the projection cursor past events that project_batch skipped on error (incremental.rs:292), and ensure_projection unconditionally deletes the dirty marker after rebuild (mod.rs:83) — so a transiently-skipped item.create is permanently lost until re-created. Fix: force full rebuild when dirty marker present, and only clear marker when rebuild had 0 projection errors (surface error count via ApplyReport/RebuildReport)."}	blake3:_bvR6JkGamSAR2LKy0Dkn60H832DWFJD9fV3MjdxtUA
